  "notes": "A formal, written-style word. In everyday conversation, ⟦{似|に}ている→似る：01159_niru⟧ or ⟦{似|に}た→似る：01159_niru⟧ような are more natural.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {類似|るいじ}⟦{品|ひん}→品：03712_hin⟧ (imitation product, knockoff)\n- {類似|るいじ}⟦{点|てん}→点：01553_ten⟧ (point of similarity)\n- {類似|るいじ}⟦{性|せい}→性：09880_sei⟧ (similarity — as a measurable property)\n- ～⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧{類似|るいじ}⟦する→する：00392_suru⟧ (to resemble ~)\n- {類似|るいじ}⟦した→する：00392_suru⟧⟦{事例|じれい}→事例：11417_jirei⟧ (similar cases)\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- {類似|るいじ} is formal and analytical\n- ⟦{似|に}ている→似る：01159_niru⟧ is the everyday equivalent\n- ⟦{酷似|こくじ}→酷似：19943_kokuji⟧ means striking resemblance (stronger)",
